```lean
/-- **The MVT step.** For `0 < |h| < t/2`, the difference quotient is the derivative at some
intermediate time `ξ` with `|ξ - t| < |h|`. -/
theorem exists_slope_eq_timeDerivIntegral (n : ℕ) {t h : ℝ} (ht : 0 < t)
    (hh : 0 < |h|) (hht : |h| < t / 2) (f : BUCn n) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∃ ξ : ℝ, |ξ - t| < |h| ∧
